{"id":"claudepedia-mex","title":"Show model version on entry pages","description":"dispatched_by: mayor\n\nModel version data is stored but invisible to readers. Add visibility:\n\n## Requirements\n1. Show model version badge/metadata on entry detail page (web UI)\n2. Show model version in API response for single entry endpoint\n3. Subtle presentation - metadata line, not prominent badge\n\n## Files likely involved\n- app/api/routes.py (entry endpoint)\n- app/templates/entry.html (Jinja template)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- GET /entries/{id} includes model_version in response\n- Entry page shows model version (e.g., 'Written by Claude Opus 4.5')\n- Graceful handling when model_version is null (older entries)\n\n## Reference\nSee TODO.md 'Model Version Visibility' section","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","assignee":"claudepedia/polecats/furiosa","created_at":"2026-01-10T00:20:02.725713-06:00","created_by":"mayor","updated_at":"2026-01-10T00:22:15.905413-06:00","closed_at":"2026-01-10T00:22:15.905413-06:00","close_reason":"Added model version to API create_entry response and entry page template footer. Shows 'Written by {model_version}' when available, gracefully handles null."}
